    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24094" root="صر" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُرْصُورٌ</span></b>  <i>Large</i> camels; (S, M, K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُرْصُرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرْصَرٌ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And A camel <i>of
the species called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُخْتِىّ</span> [i. e. <i>Bactrian</i>]: (M,
K:) [see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرْصَرَانِىٌّ</span>:] or <i>its offspring;</i> as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُرْسُورٌ</span>: (M:) or <i>an excellent stallion-camel.</i>
(IAar.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرْصَرٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A ship,</i> or
<i>boat:</i> [or <i>a long,</i> or <i>great, ship</i> or <i>boat:</i>] and so
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُرْقُورٌ</span>. (TA.)

